{"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Trackers"}],"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Property","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"rejectionReports"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV","text":"AsyncQueue"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers15RejectionReportV","text":"RejectionReport"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Trackers\/Tracker.swift#L364","fileName":"Tracker.swift"},"symbolKind":"property","title":"rejectionReports","externalID":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV16rejectionReports11AsyncQueues0E5QueueVyAA15RejectionReportVGvp"},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker"]]},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A report of each event the tracker rejected because a property broke a constraint declared"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"on it, in the order the rejections happen."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rejectionReports","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncQueue","preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/AsyncQueues\/documentation\/AsyncQueues\/AsyncQueue"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"RejectionReport","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers15RejectionReportV","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/RejectionReport"},{"text":"> { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The tracker’s worker checks each event’s "},{"code":"constraintViolation()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" before anything else, so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rejected event is never enriched, held by a consent, written to a store or delivered. A"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"record a store recovered is checked too, and one rejected is forgotten by the store. In"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"debug builds each rejection is also logged at error level."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Reports wait until they are read, merged: a rejection joins the waiting report of the same"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"event, property and keyword, adding to its count and widening its timestamps. So the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reports waiting unread are at most one per constraint the app declares, however many events"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"break them. Copies of a tracker share one sequence, which ends once the tracker has"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"finished and every report has been read. A "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/noOp"},{"type":"text","text":" tracker’s is empty."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"One task reads the reports at a time. The first iterator to read holds them until its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"iteration ends or it is released; a second reader meanwhile waits its turn, logging a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"warning once, then reads on from the next report, so the first gets every report in order."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A reader cancelled while it waits returns "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/rejectionreports"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/rejectionReports","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"references":{"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/trackers","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The tracker app code tracks events with, and what it applies to each event before it is delivered: enrichers, samplers and consent."}],"type":"topic","title":"Trackers"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/RejectionReport":{"url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/rejectionreport","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Events a tracker rejected because a property broke a constraint declared on it: the event’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"name, the property and the keyword it broke, how many were rejected and when they were tracked."}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","title":"RejectionReport","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"RejectionReport","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"RejectionReport","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/RejectionReport"},"doc://AsyncQueues/documentation/AsyncQueues/AsyncQueue":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AsyncQueues\/documentation\/AsyncQueues\/AsyncQueue","url":"\/documentation\/asyncqueues\/asyncqueue","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Elements in the order they are enqueued, kept until they are read; one reader at a time reads"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"them."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"AsyncQueue"}],"title":"AsyncQueue","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"AsyncQueue"}]},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/records-swift.property":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"records","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV","text":"Tracker","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV7RecordsV","text":"Records","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The records of the events this tracker tracks, for a delivery to read."}],"kind":"symbol","title":"records","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/records-swift.property","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/noOp":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/noOp","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/noop","abstract":[{"text":"A tracker that drops every event, logging each one at debug level. Its ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"empty.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","title":"noOp","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"noOp"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Tracker","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker":{"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Tracker","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Tracker","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"Tracker","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"What app code tracks events with: it records each event, with the time, the caller’s source","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"location and the task’s context, as one of its ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/rejectionReports":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/rejectionReports","abstract":[{"text":"A report of each event the tracker rejected because a property broke a constraint declared","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"on it, in the order the rejections happen.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/rejectionreports","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rejectionReports","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV","text":"AsyncQueue","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers15RejectionReportV","text":"RejectionReport","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"title":"rejectionReports","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol"}}}